Usage:
  kanban-md [command]

Available Commands:
  agent-name  Generate a unique agent name for claims
  archive     Archive a task (soft-delete)
  board       Show board summary
  completion  Generate shell completion script
  config      View or modify board configuration
  context     Generate a board context summary
  create      Create a new task
  delete      Delete a task
  edit        Edit a task
  handoff     Hand off a task (move to review with notes)
  help        Help about any command
  init        Initialize a new kanban board
  list        List tasks
  log         Show activity log
  metrics     Show flow metrics
  move        Move a task to a different status
  pick        Pick the next available task
  show        Show task details
  skill       Manage agent skills
  tui         Open the interactive board UI

Flags:
      --compact      compact one-line-per-record output
      --dir string   path to kanban directory
  -h, --help         help for kanban-md
      --json         output as JSON
      --no-color     disable color output
      --oneline      alias for --compact
      --table        output as table
  -v, --version      version for kanban-md

